WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:02.700
Rhaenyra Targaryen: I will be Queen of the
Seven Kingdoms.

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:09.450
Alicent Hightower: You may do as you wish,
when I am cold in my grave.

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:16.590
Daemon Targaryen: Dreams didn’t make us
kings, dragons did.

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:25.029
Alicent: The people remember the ancient strenght
of House Targaryen.

00:00:25.029 --> 00:00:30.529
Otto Hightower: No king has ever lived that
hasn’t had to forfeit the lives of the few

00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:31.929
to protect the many.

00:00:31.929 --> 00:00:36.940
Corlys Velaryon: Our houses are bound by a
common cause.

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:52.789
Daemon: Perhaps, but there 

00:00:52.789 --> 00:01:05.259
will be blood.

